From: Chase Payne <chase_payne@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 23:44:13 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(display): add terminal-session display driver

Console IddCx adapters cannot serve RemoteDisplayEnum sessions, leaving product-owned virtual displays unavailable to independent seats. Add a separate remote-session package from the shared driver engine, bootstrap its first monitor, and isolate its control interface by WTS session while preserving the console driver.

This is the source checkpoint; signed-package and live terminal-session validation remain pending.

